+# Repository Coverage Ledger
+
+Scan: `c7e9f28495e1_20260626T144948Z`
+Scope: `/home/coz/Downloads/blastbox`
+Worklist: `artifacts/02_discovery/deep_review_input.jsonl` (97 rows, 100% selected from rank input)
+
+This ledger tracks high-impact boundary/family coverage. Candidate ids are links to findings when present; rows without candidates are still coverage rows.
+
+| Row | Boundary / Area | Family | Files / Controls Checked | Disposition | Candidate IDs | Evidence / Closure |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| COV-001 | Deploy helper scripts and rootfs build | Command execution / operator-controlled deployment | `deploy/firecracker/build-rootfs.sh`, `deploy/redeploy-warm.sh`, `scripts/test-fc.sh`, `scripts/test-gvisor-cr.sh` | suppressed | | Reviewed by shards 0001 and 0002 where applicable. These are local operator/deploy scripts, not remote runtime entrypoints; command invocations are operator-selected and not fed by job data. |
