| BB-FD-S0006-001 | ssrf-file-read:src/blastbox/engines/urlgrab.py:135 | src/blastbox/engines/urlgrab.py:93 | Job input URL plus attacker-controlled redirect `Location` | urllib default opener follows to `file:` and `UrlGrabEngine` writes/seals `body.bin` | reportable | yes | high (0.86) | Requires exposed UrlGrab and reachable initial HTTP(S) endpoint; live socket 302 not exercised; worker-local sensitive file depends on deployment. |
