+| COV-002 | Deploy Firecracker and gVisor guest entrypoints | Dynamic engine selection / sandbox boundary | `deploy/firecracker/run_guest.py`, `deploy/firecracker/engines.py`, `deploy/gvisor/run_warm.py` | suppressed | | Reviewed by shards 0001 and 0002. Engine selection is baked/operator-controlled via files/env, not job-controlled; no candidate emitted. |
+| COV-003 | Seccomp/AppArmor deploy policy | Sandbox hardening profile | `deploy/seccomp/blastbox.seccomp.json`, `deploy/seccomp/blastbox.seccomp.policy`, `deploy/apparmor/*` | suppressed | | Shard 0002 reviewed seccomp JSON; generated rank input excluded AppArmor README/profile text as deploy config, not Python runtime. Profiles are operator-applied defense-in-depth, not an attacker-controlled parser surface. |
+| COV-004 | Contract envelope and artifact sealing | Path traversal / host file read/write / output trust | `src/blastbox/contract/envelope.py`, `src/blastbox/host/trust.py` | open | | Shard 0005 reviewed contract files with no candidate. Parent review confirms fd-based confined opens, `O_NOFOLLOW`, count/byte caps, metadata path reservation, and input-sha checks; awaiting host trust shard receipt before final closure. |
+| COV-005 | Contract node registry and payload parsing | Parser/resource exhaustion / unsafe dynamic types | `src/blastbox/contract/nodes.py`, `src/blastbox/contract/walk.py`, `src/blastbox/contract/leaf.py` | suppressed | | Shard 0005 reviewed core node files with no candidate. Parent review confirmed payload depth and list length controls in envelope parsing; no dynamic type source from remote clients beyond registered engine code. |
+| COV-006 | Example engines | Command execution / SSRF | `src/blastbox/engines/detonate.py`, `src/blastbox/engines/urlgrab.py` | open | | Runtime examples can be deployed as engines; awaiting shard receipt before closure. |
+| COV-007 | Ingress API submit/list/status/delete | Auth/authz / upload DoS / open deployment | `src/blastbox/host/ingress/app.py`, `src/blastbox/host/ingress/middleware.py`, `src/blastbox/host/cli.py` | open | | Parent review found localhost default, optional bearer auth warning, body limits, param caps, job id validation, and no tenant model by design. Awaiting shard receipt; possible deployment-hardening note if no stronger exposed-default path appears. |
+| COV-008 | Artifact and result serving | Path traversal / undeclared artifact disclosure | `src/blastbox/host/ingress/app.py`, `src/blastbox/host/ingress/extension.py` | open | | Parent review confirms manifest membership checks, `_safe_artifact_path`, symlink rejection, fixed-path extension helper gates, and recomputed output dir. Awaiting shard receipt. |
+| COV-009 | Job store backends | SQL injection / deserialization / race ownership | `src/blastbox/host/jobs/sql_store.py`, `src/blastbox/host/jobs/redis_store.py`, `src/blastbox/host/jobs/memory.py`, `src/blastbox/host/jobs/base.py` | open | | Parent review confirms bound SQL values, allowlisted dynamic columns/sorts, JSON not pickle for Redis, WATCH/MULTI claim, and claim_id ownership. Awaiting shard receipt. |
+| COV-010 | Dispatcher launch and param forwarding | Docker argv injection / env override / insecure runtime | `src/blastbox/host/dispatch.py`, `src/blastbox/host/runtime/docker.py`, `src/blastbox/host/cli.py` | open | | Parent review confirms operator-derived images, list argv, reserved env prefixes/keys, per-engine allowlists, runtime fail-closed default, and hardened docker flags. Awaiting shard receipt. |
+| COV-011 | Worker harness and sandbox selection | Sandbox escape / host env leakage / worker output trust | `src/blastbox/worker/harness.py`, `src/blastbox/worker/sandbox/*.py`, `src/blastbox/worker/cold.py`, `src/blastbox/worker/load.py` | open | | Awaiting worker shard receipts. |
+| COV-012 | Network egress overlay | SSRF / unauthorized egress / non-TCP or IPv6 leak | `src/blastbox/host/netpolicy.py`, `src/blastbox/host/netapply.py`, `src/blastbox/host/netwire.py`, `src/blastbox/host/netd.py` | open | | Parent review confirms `none` reserved, unknown personalities skipped, override gated, netns-wired tiers gated to runc, gateway required, filter knobs constrained, and leak guard as precondition. Awaiting shard receipt. |
+| COV-013 | Warm pool and snapshot runtimes | Worker reuse / stale output / snapshot isolation | `src/blastbox/host/pool.py`, `src/blastbox/host/runtime/*snapshot*`, `src/blastbox/host/runtime/firecracker.py`, `src/blastbox/host/runtime/gvisor_snapshot*.py` | open | | Awaiting worker shard receipts. |
+| COV-014 | Capture/decrypt artifacts | Host-side file write / pcap/keylog handling | `src/blastbox/host/capture.py`, `src/blastbox/host/decrypt.py`, `src/blastbox/host/netd.py`, dispatcher capture sealing helpers | open | | Parent review confirms capture directory confinement and symlink checks in dispatcher; awaiting shard receipt for capture/decrypt modules. |
+| COV-015 | Similarity search / page hash indexing | Query injection / resource exhaustion | `src/blastbox/host/ingress/similar.py`, `src/blastbox/host/jobs/sql_store.py` | open | | Awaiting shard receipt; parent search indicates store gates dynamic sort fields and SQL uses bound values. |
+| COV-016 | Bench/profile tooling | Local developer command execution / trace parsing | `src/blastbox/bench/*`, `src/blastbox/profile/*` | open | | Developer/operator tools; awaiting shard receipts to close as not_applicable or suppressed. |
